# SHUTTERBUG: a kitewing drops a dart when it passes over the ship; the dart
# stabs straight back up when it lands. A toastie's crumbs bounce off rock.
game shutterbug
cheat run 1
cheat quiet
cheat stop
cheat clear
cheat god
cheat eshot 3 200 100 0 1
expect arrows_up == 0
waituntil arrows_up >= 1 80
cheat eshot 7 100 140 0 2
waituntil crumbs_bounced >= 1 30
cheat clear
cheat pos 120 140
cheat foe 21 150 30 0
waituntil eshots_3 >= 1 200
